These files are an unchanged copy of socutils lib/zgasci at commit d700f86
(branch zgasci): zgasci.c, zgasci.h, zgasci_plan.h, zgasci_kernel.inc,
zgasci_block.inc, zgasci_blas.inc. They are compiled as C99 into zshci; the
adapter is src/gas_space.cc. To take up later changes of the kernel, copy the
files again and update the commit here:

  for f in zgasci.c zgasci.h zgasci_plan.h zgasci_kernel.inc \
           zgasci_block.inc zgasci_blas.inc; do
    git -C <socutils-zgasci> show <commit>:lib/zgasci/$f > src/zgasci/$f
  done

src/gas_dist_half.inc is derived from blas_half (zgasci_blas.inc) and
term_matrix (zgasci_block.inc) of the same commit, for the MPI version: the
changes are marked "dist:" there. After a re-sync, compare those functions
with the new ones and carry the changes over.
